{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55901","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五十八 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眉间豪相焰光身，事见争如理见亲。\n事有只因於理有，理慈（《景德传灯录》卷二九作「权」）方便化天人。\n一朝大悟俱消却，方得名爲无事人。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}